WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.341
Watch and read: Ama asks: Ama feels happy. Which sentence expresses the feeling?

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:10.360
The answer is: I feel happy.. A sentence can name a person’s feelings.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:16.217
Watch and read: Ama asks: Complete: “Today I am blank .” The missing word should be a

00:00:16.217 --> 00:00:16.512
feeling.

00:00:17.367 --> 00:00:20.588
The answer is: happy. Choose a word that names a feeling.
